{{JPExclusive}}
'''2D Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] and can be obtained when beating any stage from the [[Dot Heroes Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 503
|rarity = RR
|name1 = 2D Cat
|name2 = 3D Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''3D Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role without relevant differences in quality. 2D Cat, however, can be used in {{4c}} stages, where there is considerably less competition.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

